'''George Eugene Franklin''' (born July 5, 1954) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[running back]] for the [[Atlanta Falcons]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) in 1978. He played [[college football]] for the [[Texas A&M-Kingsville Javelinas football|Texas A&M-Kingsville Javelinas]].
